{"screen_name": "xxOwO_OvOxx", "file": "xxOwO_OvOxx", "name": "みなとちゃん", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1882028162022064128/UzTv8wHr.jpg", "header_url": "", "description": "20↑社畜\nダイナモローラーを愛しています\n好きな時に絵を描いています\n3L️⭕️✧肌色多め✧\nwavebox▶https://wavebox.me/wave/5bg2ok93e7p5wspe/", "total_works": 26, "scraped_works": 26, "first_seen": "2025-09-14T11:10:22.148770", "last_updated": "2025-09-14T11:10:22.148770", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 6000, "recorded_at": "2025-09-14T11:10:22.148770"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 6000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 6000, "max": 6000}}, "links": [{"label": "Website", "url": "https://wavebox.me/wave/5bg2ok93e7p5wspe/", "name": ""}], "flags": {"from_archive": true}, "works": [{"path": "/@xxOwO_OvOxx/works/26", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8af96295/uploads/origins/f7754d54-2fc7-464c-bdc1-b038159a7791?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a96c92fdc9b94b190d17337f9f239749", "thumbnail_srcset": "", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "こんにちは、アロハです。コミッションをお願いしたいのですが。\n\nアロハが片方の手でピース・シンボルを作り、胸を見せています。\n\n\n\nキャラクター：https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/15_53HbyZuR9lmtFgfVbQOeuIq0NO2zBC?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@xxOwO_OvOxx/works/25", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/369366eb/uploads/origins/adda3d0c-7d47-4663-8a48-591064ba1f70?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=d314233385ee2498b5fea34054377fc5", "thumbnail_srcset": "", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@xxOwO_OvOxx/works/24", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f236a84c/uploads/origins/ec575398-908d-4d02-8fcb-68d7a0eedc1e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4f310ce2467d4b6ecc3503c2f7678d2a", "thumbnail_srcset": "", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "Hello, I love your work! I would wish to see my Splatoon character in your style. Down below is a link to the references. For each photo title, I will write a description and put what you can do! \nこんにちは、あなたの作品が大好きです！あなたのスタイルで私のスプラトゥーンキャラクターを見てみたいです。下に参考資料へのリンクがあります。それぞれの写真のタイトルには、説明を書いて、あなたができることを書きます！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1xMw_Vq0RMu3gN6J_2BFPbcGrsPWuu3Hb?usp=drive_link\n\nHAIR: Use the hair from here. (No eyepatch, no triangles on the cheeks, and keep the piercings. Also no hat.) Her ink color is dark blue. \nここから髪を使う。(アイパッチなし、頬の三角形なし、ピアスはそのまま。帽子もなし)\nインクの色はダークブルー。\n\nPOSE: Use this as the pose! Keep the breasts and expression the same. \nこれをポーズとして使う！胸と表情はそのままで。\n\nOUTFIT: Use this as the outfit! This character is Cendrillon from Wonderland Wars if you need more references. \nこれを衣装として使う！このキャラクターは『Wonderland Wars』のCendrillon (サンドリヨン)です。\n\nOUTFIT REFERENCE: A reference to use for how the outfit can look.\n着こなしの参考に。\n\nBACKGROUND: The background, please!\n背景をお願いします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@xxOwO_OvOxx/works/23", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/dbe7568c/uploads/origins/fe705a8a-450d-4822-a07f-d9e66236ac94?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=6f5f148c2551664e7e8b7d3c0ad4595b", "thumbnail_srcset": "", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@xxOwO_OvOxx/works/22", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/eacd7690/uploads/origins/51f1e2df-a248-4fe4-82c5-b4aec397d6a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=59375c10060b4220c20ce02b6649372d", "thumbnail_srcset": "", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@xxOwO_OvOxx/works/21", "thumbnail_src": "https://s